  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Expansion_Permit?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/3a/Expansion_Permit.png/revision/latest?cb=20170324165909\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A permit\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"A permit\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>A permit</figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Expansion permits</b> are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/supplies-23344\" title=\"Supplies\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">supplies</a> which let players unlock the 47&#160;special <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-23339\" title=\"Expansion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">expansion</a> areas containing 29&#160;unique <a href=\"/wiki/decorations-expansion-27112\" title=\"Decorations/Expansion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">decorations</a>.\n</p><p>They are unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 25.\n</p><p>Unlike other <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-23339\" title=\"Expansion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">expansion</a> items, the permits are not stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Getting permits</b></span></h3>\n<p>Unlike other <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-23339\" title=\"Expansion\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">expansion</a> items, permits cannot be bought or sold.\n</p><p>Permits can be obtained when players:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Spin the <a href=\"/wiki/wheel-of-fortune-2745\" title=\"Wheel of Fortune\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wheel of Fortune</a></li>\n<li>Reach flag checkpoints 4 and 7 in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a></li>\n<li>Find them in <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Huge Boxes</a> or in some of the Holiday Calendar Boxes on Greg's farm</li>\n<li>Earn them during <a href=\"/wiki/events-7210\" title=\"Events\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Special Boat Events</a></li>\n<li>Buy them in <a href=\"/wiki/valley-shop-31468\" title=\"Valley Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Valley Shop</a> or play lucky bonus in valley <a href=\"/wiki/daily-quest-31469\" title=\"Daily Quest\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Daily Quest</a> until the 2nd round or above is reached</li>\n<li>Complete checkpoints on either free or paid <a href=\"/wiki/farm-pass-34637\" title=\"Farm Pass\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Farm Pass</a></li>\n<li>Purchase using real money in diamond shop at \"Offer\" section.</li></ul>\n<p>At their first appearance, they could also be obtained when a player:\n</p>\n<ul><li>Open <a href=\"/wiki/mystery-box-6452\" title=\"Mystery Box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mystery boxes</a></li>\n<li>Reach <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level thresholds</li></ul>\n<p>...but these possibilities were removed in a subsequent update. Subsequently, they were added back to \"huge\" mystery boxes, but not to \"regular\" or \"large\" mystery boxes.\n</p><p>Once players have the number of permits needed to unlock all areas, they will not get any more permits (unless and until new plots requiring permits are added in subsequent updates).\n</p><p>A total of 643 permits are needed to clear all 50 expansion areas that were introduced through the Summer 2021 update.  Detailed maps of each expansion area can be found <a href=\"/wiki/expansion-farm-30757\" title=\"Expansion/Farm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.\n</p><p>After the Spring 2023 update, a total of 1345 permits are needed to clear all available expansion areas.\n</p>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>You can see how many permits you have by tapping on a locked area on the south-east of your farm that has access to a nearby road or by tapping your level star.</li>\n<li>Expansion Permits will only appear in derby prize columns 4 and 7, so if you opt to spend 5 diamonds to reshuffle the derby prizes to earn Expansion Permits, remember not to select a prize in columns 4 or 7 prior to shuffling as these are the only two columns where it is possible to be awarded Expansion Permits.</li>\n<li>There is a soft limit on the number of expansion permits you can own/store, which is 15 plus the number of permits required to buy all remaining land.  Once you reach this threshold, permits will no longer be available from derby, valley, and some event catalogs.  Permits can still be collected from rewards such as the final event prize from county fair events.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/axe-3051\" title=\"Axe (9 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/fb/Axe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191028130205\" title=\"Axe (9 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Axe (9 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><